              &gt; <a href=3D"https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-iana-=
registry-updates/pull/65" rel=3D"noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">https://gith=
ub.com/tlswg/draft<wbr>-ietf-tls-iana-registry-update<wbr>s/pull/65</a><br>
              &gt;<br>
              &gt; One further point brought out in discussions with
              Adam was that if we=E2=80=99re really closing the HashAlgorit=
hm
              and SignatureAlgorithms registry we need to also mark
              224-255 as deprecated.=C2=A0 Currently these are marked as
              Reserved for Private Use.=C2=A0 So the question is should we
              mark 224-255 as deprecated in these two registries?<br>
